{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:3bf446d55f40d76667707ee45a401d81d9c0b5d013098243151e938f373d4c18",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4eff6c8eea03b06b21331ecbd46c29e4b820488c3d466bd39977154698f78425",
      "text": "渡边实的前传",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c0fc26a0d395a7023ae6f08573d4678a2d0e10fcd9a0a8fe8131704465e66736",
      "text": "为了世界和平，决定以偶像为目标的\n3人。在准备参加315 Production试镜\n的过程中，恭二开始思考起自己并不了解的\n皮埃尔与实两人的过去。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_a:cmd-000020:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b3a0c7f8f83c9759bf38e90e810580beff52236c88683724b5c13d354d17d97d",
      "text": "第3话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_a:cmd-000020:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4eff6c8eea03b06b21331ecbd46c29e4b820488c3d466bd39977154698f78425",
      "text": "渡边实的前传",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_a:cmd-000031:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_a:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f234b7ad93ba362d29f81509dd00566e3df016a57275ec33e392fc4ea6b1fb1b",
      "text": "好了。关于“怎样才能当上偶像！”\n这个话题……在那之前。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_a:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:84bf2984ec7cbf40acbb219095c2f88105cc753c12073fb5ad0b847bdbf9c9aa",
      "text": "你们两个本来知道“偶像”到底\n是个什么东西吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_a:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:81909a58d4b2952efa044cd172d38114bbdff20006364b82b704707ab4272004",
      "text": "……说实话，没什么实感。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_a:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:adba5003807371eb7b91349dbf1fc30a236897df5353fad12329371022291d10",
      "text": "我知道！偶像就是闪闪发光。\n在电视上唱歌、跳舞！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_a:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d6e0ee9bb8ce6c8ca3ff722aae3e73198e8f097b0e5e7b66d53abe4a33ce9387",
      "text": "没说错。不过，可不仅限于此哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_a:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:293325b349fee66aee843e77d51509489c659793c2ce9ab6c193ea41688439ac",
      "text": "比如说，为了给当地带来活力，\n将活动大本营固定在当地的本地偶像。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_a:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5a6d89da6f93244aba301a653ce2e1249dcd084c7d0094ad2cc7d6292b0ee6df",
      "text": "为了贯彻自己的风格，\n特意不去主流市场出道的独立偶像。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_a:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cb41253c22cc6ec76443b3ac9d42039f375d34e75eaf2743bbf9e080dab6d320",
      "text": "还有足不出户与粉丝交流的\n网络偶像之类的呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_a:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b16cb7c3bf49a1d10bcebccd873a45f543a6837ebd0888c6bc5f5d99676f3d44",
      "text": "要介绍的话还多得很呢，偶像可是有着\n各种各样的形式与风格的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_a:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:55fc4fc69190f21facc6ebea4138c893601b34dcee4d61d36c1ec62eacff3dc9",
      "text": "哦哦——……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_b:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:50df62d2d6c895c9c1d270e58149e1377495f547a63fff87823d70f7ce2566bb",
      "text": "偶像有好多好多……！好厉害！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_b:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4a03ef5bace839fcb9b6d5b653ddd2d5828d1696104d3af5c9a97f17e2dbaa99",
      "text": "真不愧是你，懂得真多啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_b:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6f6fdf56c33cecf4a70e78ce21f8562791937d1fbc6e7d531b9a0c4025553c76",
      "text": "谢谢夸奖，两位。\n那么，关于“我们该怎么做”嘛……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_b:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b9cba9f4b4f414452a9633d40108a29aed029f0306471fbf98fdcfa588e8efef",
      "text": "我觉得一开始果然还是应该先了解最基础的东西。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_b:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aee51246559b3bdef21b3e36780966b76fceb7cddc7d3e706cb4c1bfaa1c86ba",
      "text": "偶像究竟是怎么一回事，\n由我们自己去亲身体会非常重要。所以……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_b:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:000c204b9087f749fc45845996db5281d9c85ad710c85a9acab6ac715f753bab",
      "text": "我们就先去直接参加一次\n偶像事务所的试镜试试看吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_b:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0803f9c3804a9f287c6770dd3663894a84a979bdbebec57db76567e411ad3e81",
      "text": "试、试镜吗……\n就跟面试差不多吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_b:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1df694b836170b8bb2101d670bb913ac6f3997eea6645cfd3250ec1c59baec2f",
      "text": "哦——……！我参加过人偶装的面试。\n偶像的面试我也能加油！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_b:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:58f65a7592f3c39b03c580d74859dbe34e6224fa88a90df45891eb31dc083b2b",
      "text": "实。偶像的面试要怎么参加？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_b:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:77856847555cf5ca234ff9a30a5413138c2db84407ce4e836befa1ab4cd78f2d",
      "text": "和打工一样，杂志上有详细的招募信息哦。\n看，就像这样。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_b:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ae84700026dbba35c95b76f88b2b39abb24f05615c6c5ab981fec7217a4b7ba",
      "text": "偶像事务所的网站上也可能会有，\n就由我把信息整理出来吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_b:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3f26e12abb55d06957c9905a80283d61e6642f0443557dfc18408ec10331786e",
      "text": "那么……就等实先生的消息了。\n明天同一时间再集合吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_c:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de032b14ad770092a08e64ee0b7359b1bdf150548e5d96e8eacb1487cc8ae481",
      "text": "翌日……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_c:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bda13aa02b505e5310fc02a763b56e2349a1907424701db711571986be59674a",
      "text": "哇……！\n好厉害好厉害！情报，好多！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_c:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0e4101809de5d2fbafd938158348f7dbe26847d6cf33fe2a0082260355abcdc3",
      "text": "偶像事务所，比想象中的还要多啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_c:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4b89245ca07ed79227ec2ff78ff25f099e3bb56d161c2e9568e99dc02287b0b4",
      "text": "我把它们都摆在这边，\n有感兴趣的就告诉我哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_c:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:60255d100e6e33fa63b3766edc24df28887bdb530bf811cfe69291da6f66e5bd",
      "text": "好。感兴趣的……感兴趣的……\n……这数量太多了，好难选啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_c:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f3396e4b5915a51bfb8c61c4c8ce3611a0d2fc2e1b73cbe1124deab6858c21ad",
      "text": "真是的，这已经是我严格筛选过的了哦？\n实际上比这还要多得多呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_c:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fb96268749c613be0bdbd4fff9d49814c4426bd27502ceca48546ed02421a211",
      "text": "抱、抱歉。我会挑一挑的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_c:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1dd838c28872022fd4edea39b3ba66891abe6e4d434ac56e50d8e5653f2a53ef",
      "text": "呵呵。有什么不懂的，随时问我！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_c:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c880a73a02599fb4e053dfdc320aae2a059eb37eb8c48a530ca4091c34682dfe",
      "text": "（这家……连我都听说过。\n不过这种大公司，怎么看都……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_c:cmd-000112:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fd8248296ce83ca3398dd73b830d288f9cf18552eec0c16226c4c503d7668213",
      "text": "嗯～？恭二，这个事务所怎么念？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_d:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b853d59061239eeecbebdd025be826f79e539c30e2f6e625249ad50149aebdb2",
      "text": "呃……三、一、五、Production……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_d:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f57c2104c33a28db529816bea7331b307291ad069943fb477d9aa08ff17b74e5",
      "text": "？三、草莓（いちご）、三……Production？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_d:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f320814e5e0e871e08fc86956d3fa967e44a185ac35e4a4bc5139cfb8c1b8d55",
      "text": "不对，大概不是这么念。实先生，这个怎么念……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_d:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e620ce2bbe16f25fb9dba906ef4f5bf202fe039f16701e306d7d3d8c9964b927",
      "text": "啊！这个要读作“Saikou”哦。\n315 Production。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_d:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5550ac5e1cc1e8f176d67bc601c35cd25b14626a1c9c644a235287df0236477d",
      "text": "315读作Saikou啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_d:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bffeb4d19fdae0133f31d6b1d4907ce6f489dec67f2b27a222ec79714ff87d5c",
      "text": "挺有意思的名字吧。\n大概是取“最高（Saikou）”的谐音吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_d:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:32d6032fba643bd4087bb0d09aaaf51d57e974446f35d734fc6e149f83dd7aa0",
      "text": "谐音倒不如说是冷笑话吧？\n不过，确实挺有冲击力的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_d:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0657649a6b9f94030eb437b21fa5d0b63578e0968c6b87d385ac6c6c081c8331",
      "text": "不过，“最高Production”吗。\n总感觉有种热血过头的气氛，我不一定吃得消……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_d:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9ffe4d6f1a7741ec312d11c068ba5a2ee7bd2e9d0c9ffa63143e56a038d3a5aa",
      "text": "Saikou……\n最棒的，Production……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_d:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:10d3f254de8fb83d5dd2cbad3acc624da0853e8dfd31d701f77bd4c1e011a52f",
      "text": "实，恭二！\n我们要参加的试镜，就定这家吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_e:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7568aa37ed6aa6bab19afc93d20b42ec021a9fdf3718c3add0f4d2e93b5d086d",
      "text": "诶……315 Production吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_e:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:64c1ffae6ff4033947c4d70762f68ea1048e1383b5e670fd38d7c539e4f49aa4",
      "text": "我想去这里！\n想参加315 Production的试镜！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_e:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7b01f7826fbf5f10d4b59679a3db611c27361513b1f127189516a865d37d5ff1",
      "text": "看来你相当中意呢，皮埃尔。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_e:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:16e4bd1201050dcd14ed81c6708ee73b8c448e917678fa677b149d0b3c7d3dc4",
      "text": "嗯！因为名字非常棒！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_e:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4550f89966b7cc6714fecefeb3739a0f58010fdcd6adfbf20a5d11a7ba1cb6c0",
      "text": "最高，就是非常非常闪亮的意思！对不对？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_e:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c576a542053f38921c9447f505e24bc2e66109802b80e8e81fdec03363ffb6c",
      "text": "我想让大家都变得闪亮。\n要是进了闪亮的地方，我和大家就都闪闪发光了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_e:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:867f6fce6adedb8e22ad6af7d25b3d7dcac1f7453d60296b92d2e5987fae8641",
      "text": "实先生觉得怎么样？这家事务所。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_e:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3a0129a2250a635c429c076aa3f940d97366e52f418b8df3a30c1864b0cdfa9c",
      "text": "我觉得挺好的呀。虽然是家新事务所，\n但嗯，感觉挺正规的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_e:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d02ad2f9d8b79ce754b006cc4c3cce0524c3e166da3bc103aa50aface471d13b",
      "text": "上面写着无论什么样的人都非常欢迎，\n只要我们努力，应该也是有机会的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_e:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:18180db546817ae626b04d7932806c8ef3d026f7a6617900afc5630860f692cd",
      "text": "这样啊。既然你们两个都这么说……那我就去吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_e:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b9f5b8e30dcfce3aa22779bc4fed43a650facee5875326a4ad7d05f2dd035438",
      "text": "太好啦！那就这么定了。\n得赶快准备简历才行！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_f:cmd-000030:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_f:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7a197c6b4fd814f9d8dc54e01d440e2a64fb01046a0e5ebeb50f3b9cd6aa6e2c",
      "text": "那么大家，今天也辛苦啦。\n特别是皮埃尔。回去要好好休息哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_f:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5f16f9472fed1f532482fea89601bd535c93737c2a94412c4ba042ab0ee716f8",
      "text": "嗯……我累坏了……呼噜……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_f:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:63b1b271ac194cbcb80c6d3ab35a2a3a3b1c7317df017bc99ded0f283088d57f",
      "text": "因为今天为了填好简历，\n一直都在和日语大眼瞪小眼嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_f:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:31f13cbedd65f06dd0d6d270ab598cbd67111177f64f9e303fa72a772537773f",
      "text": "这次要思考和要写的东西，\n确实有很多啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_f:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:db366e14db7f0c5cc12e2944f09069f633157830f6d943f23e3802a65f44d120",
      "text": "不过你很了不起哦，皮埃尔。\n确确实实靠自己的力量写完了一整张。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_f:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9aa785a0d0be075cd1476ca11698b374eea5d104b0a933ea9566f92f2a0267a1",
      "text": "嗯……嘿嘿，我很努力了……呼噜。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_f:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:59af729e72e6420831d39715746c9cb166aa6b9ad087a9a8917abddcbdb2ecf8",
      "text": "实，还有恭二，谢谢你们……\n先、帮我的、写好了……呼噜。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_f:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ddb51599dc26f3943db4c35ed07b39b20e02af0def9ef0243f10cad0c05c993f",
      "text": "行了行了。你看，保镖先生在担心你了哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_f:cmd-000143:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:97c6ae5fc1a81dc75c30eb4c64cf029af3c4420701d78edc74cb0d00b026b676",
      "text": "对了，恭二。关于贴在简历上的照片，\n照相馆的大叔说可以帮我们拍哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_f:cmd-000146:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6055fb6f3a702f9c247423f146d02ad137094aaa83db2e154825bf4a7a45ae39",
      "text": "诶。是我们商店街那家吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_f:cmd-000152:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:72a9b29b4bfea9905817c6bee82ebae793a7de77fb9f998d75cd476dacbfa8c1",
      "text": "嗯。我和他说想为了世界和平以偶像为目标，\n他就说愿意帮忙……大家都是好人呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_g:cmd-000010:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6a641b7db95e069820cee1141a157e3f5e598505f59c69b420f38fc180e23b50",
      "text": "恭二的公寓",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_g:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d965b3dfcdd010d781d5b6617cca975d1b95774fc8d91e54262d43c4aa165f28",
      "text": "……学历和工作经历这样就行了吧。\n惨了，写错字了……重新写一张吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_g:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:30a8b550ceeadbb34b90a060532999a8ed7fe31022122c4f77e35b8ac154bd1d",
      "text": "（话说回来，实先生。虽然早就知道他喜欢偶像……\n但没想到他了解得这么透彻）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_g:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:74843d7901469cdb54c5cbfac4ed80344b99be4aeb8e745c5cf5e022852fb892",
      "text": "（关于偶像的种类啦、挑事务所之类的事。\n要是只有我和皮埃尔，肯定会更头疼）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_g:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8d47f12927885ded124c50576b92904d885f903a3be1a9a61ea1b7674f1cb9cf",
      "text": "……说起来，实先生为什么\n会那么喜欢偶像呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_g:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b7af996df9241d04d16bb998b0c31e0ce00cc62a686a0a3238898eb772256ac5",
      "text": "……仔细想想，我……\n其实并不怎么了解那个人的过去啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_g:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b091dcf4caa753ae9614cf32787b13607708ac24ed2ef91725b6167efd884e56",
      "text": "（在花店工作，脸上总是挂着笑容。\n虽然一直看到的都是这副样子……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_g:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b75d25c57f3d85076bee8981f1527a7356c4446e71f77d71c56003b364dc3079",
      "text": "在遇到我们之前，他是做什么的呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_g:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:78d227f2b82173911592ea4e8f1ef175b3b59ce5e27ccf81a9bebe5d0683684d",
      "text": "（……不。说到底，我们三个人之间，\n本来就有很多彼此不知道的事）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_g:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5d82ee70aa9006ea404b3bc7c2b9eca8cf7d25c164afc3dc4ffe5071fda8937b",
      "text": "（我不愿意提家里的事，皮埃尔也\n不管怎么看都满身是谜。现在才想这些也太迟了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_g:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:08933aa0ca3a1c378746c50ef2e2eec6d269adb0b9d039dc03ab27c152603e81",
      "text": "（即使如此……他们也是很好相处的好人）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_g:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:27f0907a92a541a39fd04db5dbcead96ecead9ddac9006bc107de9fc9467aa72",
      "text": "好了。别发呆了，\n赶紧把自己的简历写完吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_h:cmd-000010:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5ffff23e39cb8131b51a351d9a80cacffd4583b1cbd18e1c15ab0edb3b848521",
      "text": "实的房间",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_h:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f73abe7422f1bc87e0571cfded3dadb920cc40df1f514c95dd9bdd491b55a1a8",
      "text": "我回来了——\n呼，今天店里也好忙啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_h:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5fd3c027cc4e18c81c93ca49c7ff3281f55d1693699590d3593ac856cdf33d4b",
      "text": "啊，不过简历……今天之内得写完才行。\n这种事情就得趁热打铁嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_h:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f578b8224ae5153e25e98160f86d89a0313b53876cb4e24f37ab0d0587f5b557",
      "text": "嘿咻。那个，简历不是这本……\n找到了找到了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_h:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9428ea23091910d45edd85ebd09af1abc32cd9a6410248955c35df52ff476177",
      "text": "渡边实。年龄，31岁……\n接下来是学历和经历……啊，个人优势吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_h:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8dae09a6ca394aa0908e47449077023cdb7c688057e3219a47a751cae873ea4a",
      "text": "喜欢偶像。……想要探求偶像——也就是被人供奉的神像——\n吸引人心的真正原因，因此自己也……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_h:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3596441991a047d4e2a5957a156a36e495d7732d135fa15bc08f745f8ff44d5a",
      "text": "……要是这么长篇大论，未免有点恶心吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_h:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:799076f1ba844ecbea4fd9c05103a81c85217b80d75f2a6f12f535ab18a1b9c1",
      "text": "还是简简单单写成喜欢偶像吧。\n不过，要是被问到的话我可要大说特说了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_h:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3a0426513cf0a98e700f598d44be09e1e4c2d68370ef132163a025c7c66ebab9",
      "text": "……嗯，这样差不多了吧？\n最后一栏，就写上我们三个人商量好的那句话吧。……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_h:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1091c7fb05bcb98f55d08bbe7b1c5437a599a6c680782861ae08bf061695b343",
      "text": "呵呵。人生还真是什么都说不准呢。\n……对吧，叔叔。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_i:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8488a8ca9c4957c1b7975867ce5c7bb43d94242142a0c52f2f7cfdb4e26a9539",
      "text": "……要是叔叔还活着，知道我现在\n在挑战什么的话，一定会大吃一惊吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_i:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c589ee7551f9c77a75e132b12c427f4eebe1305c503a6650a0a212398942d1fb",
      "text": "其实我打算参加一家叫做315 Production的\n事务所的试镜。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_i:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bd5fa532937621a1922fb707af455b2801033b1ae6182bf8e4372fc67d3f6296",
      "text": "你猜是什么事务所？\n……告诉你吧，是偶像事务所哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_i:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:175bd5bc85035cc87fc33570be168e61515ecfdbf1c3084af4b062d58aa2d22c",
      "text": "不敢相信吧？\n要是了解以前的我，这根本就是天方夜谭对吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_i:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:241f5e95f895e65af7f3a331e63fe11d5f960b9a0f627c62e043ce62dc101fcc",
      "text": "……那个四处惹事生非的“茨城鬼神”，\n竟然想要去当偶像什么的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_i:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3eab322b2a06c1e76ea42fd24bdaf9685563deeb3c001546aea5a5d5b798237f",
      "text": "你觉得呢，叔叔。吓了一跳吗？\n还是说，会像往常那样对我微笑呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_i:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fd20c8eed12e205b717615c9822e49ec3a869b56184d1dca0cf6310f56dabc72",
      "text": "会在繁花簇拥之下，温柔地为我送行吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_i:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aac0aed4b41ccebfa68fc51ad34c7f2302b14c94be664a248194c0cefd8090d6",
      "text": "如果你问我：“为什么要当偶像呢？”的话……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_i:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d8525b9a225ba941e90e984899ec422c99b7dc351e67effae59da8f0fee12f0e",
      "text": "我想和叔叔聊的事，可多着呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_j:cmd-000011:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:72de2aa0b9aa78ab37b4c0079baf8cb2c6a1305a82b769b6ad5ecb0d745d81fb",
      "text": "和隔壁镇的那帮人起冲突，\n结果被人家直接占领了镇子中央……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_j:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:54133ef3e003ddda88e2f6de4c13566cb033d46f5253b7fc49618cc982717fb7",
      "text": "你们这群家伙，在搞什么名堂啊。\n我都说了多少次不要去招惹他们了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_j:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c3561c406d7d43bdbdabcefc61a0adb7c1e2e7f46ef597a9f6aa1e02a073c48",
      "text": "对、对不住！可是那些家伙，\n大模大样地把我们的地盘搅得一塌糊涂……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_j:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:502bd4d432d7db620dc1ad0a603030897c2b1d63e4ae98c82011a79030f1621e",
      "text": "本来只是想把他们赶走，\n结果我们的人被打了，一时……没忍住火……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_j:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e93a19e4970ccc66ecfb462acc154be3c4684e94058157cc37d1ee10a1ee59c7",
      "text": "那些家伙……叫我们把总长叫过去。\n但这种事，我们哪敢跟总长商量啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_j:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:16c88f2ad40f6cb7cee009df8993b2e97c260f55bc3b0f97b4dd36c51494e4ff",
      "text": "于是他们就说，要是总长不行就叫副总长……\n把“茨城鬼神”叫出来……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_j:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:804c6f5e8e0b68d9f9bf1d4189fc914c3f11f1dbb03edd7d555b742168762a8a",
      "text": "……真拿你们没办法。我知道了。\n叔叔，不好意思，我出去一趟！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_j:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c45c0eec08bf94fa9fe4e1cd40437ebf9c6c65995cc3c1ff89a30a8dc3e63a6f",
      "text": "噢……实，千万别受伤啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_j:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3b7bd2906ac4cabdbbed5b4363072a199c3a1baf5d1ed2422dd60377ba687fab",
      "text": "哈哈，虽然每次你都这么说，但别强人所难啦。\n走吧，小的们！告诉我那帮混蛋在哪！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_j:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bec5a32ddd5029544719942f9f5734811e196fe5d4b11a21262af413c7f8bd63",
      "text": "是！在这边！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_j:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c61a4cf8d8ec174c1df7839240d1a74a42c1527d0e4fdd3c5b57e25234d0d85",
      "text": "……",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
